(13936, 25, 'mobile', 'font-display', 'Настройте показ всего текста во время загрузки веб-шрифтов', 'table', '0.00', 'a:4:{s:11:\"description\";s:322:\"Чтобы пользователь мог видеть текст, пока веб-шрифты не загрузились, используйте функцию отображения шрифтов CSS. <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/web/updates/2016/02/font-display\" target=\"_blank\">Подробнее…</a>.\";s:18:\"score_display_mode\";s:6:\"binary\";s:13:\"display_value\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"details\";O:8:\"stdClass\":3:{s:5:\"items\";a:9:{i:0;O:8:\"stdClass\":2:{s:8:\"wastedMs\";s:2:\"90\";s:3:\"url\";s:185:\"<a href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/opensans/v16/mem8YaGs126MiZpBA-UFVZ0bf8pkAg.woff2\" target=\"_blank\">https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/opensans/v16/mem8YaGs126MiZpBA-UFVZ0bf8pkAg.woff2</a>\";}i:1;O:8:\"stdClass\":2:{s:8:\"wastedMs\";s:3:\"110\";s:3:\"url\";s:179:\"<a href=\"https://armopt.ru/wp-content/themes/electro/assets/fonts/font-electro.woff\" target=\"_blank\">https://armopt.ru/wp-content/themes/electro/assets/fonts/font-electro.woff</a>\";}i:2;O:8:\"stdClass\":2:{s:8:\"wastedMs\";s:3:\"108\";s:3:\"url\";s:197:\"<a href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/opensans/v16/mem5YaGs126MiZpBA-UN7rgOVuhpKKSTj5PW.woff2\" target=\"_blank\">https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/opensans/v16/mem5YaGs126MiZpBA-UN7rgOVuhpKKSTj5PW.woff2</a>\";}i:3;O:8:\"stdClass\":2:{s:3:\"url\";s:193:\"<a href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/opensans/v16/mem5YaGs126MiZpBA-UN7rgOUuhpKKSTjw.woff2\" target=\"_blank\">https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/opensans/v16/mem5YaGs126MiZpBA-UN7rgOUuhpKKSTjw.woff2</a>\";s:8:\"wastedMs\";s:3:\"107\";}i:4;O:8:\"stdClass\":2:{s:3:\"url\";s:187:\"<a href=\"https://armopt.ru/wp-content/themes/electro/assets/fonts/fa/fa-solid-900.woff2\" target=\"_blank\">https://armopt.ru/wp-content/themes/electro/assets/fonts/fa/fa-solid-900.woff2</a>\";s:8:\"wastedMs\";s:3:\"130\";}i:5;O:8:\"stdClass\":2:{s:8:\"wastedMs\";s:3:\"111\";s:3:\"url\";s:189:\"<a href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/opensans/v16/mem8YaGs126MiZpBA-UFUZ0b